  m_Text: "\u2022 Swipe up, down, left, or right to move tiles.\n\n\u2022 Tiles with
    the same number merge into one.\n\n\u2022 Reach 2048 to win!\n\n\u2022 Use Undo,
    Swap, and Delete to get out of tight spots."
